00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:20.510
Well first, let's consider the training set.

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:27.550
It turns out that deep learning algorithms are quite robust to random errors in the training set.

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:35.470
So long as your errors or your incorrectly labeled examples, so long as those errors are not too far from random,

