so you're going to find a hundred examples where your classifier output disagrees with the label

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:40.270
in your depth set. And sometimes for a few of those examples, your classifier disagrees with

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:44.910
the label because the label was wrong rather than because your classifier was wrong. So maybe in

