look at to try to decide if it's worth going in and reducing the number of mislabeled examples

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:14.270
out of the following. I recommend you look at the overall depth set error. And so in the example

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:20.670
we had from the previous video, we said that maybe your system has 90% overall accuracy,

