So 6% of 10% is 0.6%. And then you should look at errors due to all other causes. So if you

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:51.790
made 10% error on your depth set and if 0.6% of those are because the labels is wrong, then the

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:58.430
remainder, 9.4% of them are due to other causes, such as misrecognizing dogs, great cats, great

