the algorithm and I trained it and it worked. And, you know, there is a lot of truth to that.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:51.280
In the deep learning era, there is more of feeding data to an algorithm and just training it

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:56.640
and doing less hand engineering and using less human insight. But I think that in building

00:11:56.640 --> 00:12:02.720
